{"work":"lit-country-of-the-blind-and-other-stories","version":"pg11870","book":"country-of-the-blind-and-other-stories","chapter":29,"title":"Part 3 · Chapter 1","verses":[
{"v":"1","t":"Bru-a-a-a."},
{"v":"2","t":"I listened, not understanding."},
{"v":"3","t":"Wa-ra-ra-ra."},
{"v":"4","t":"\"Good Lord!\" said I, still only half awake. \"What an infernal shindy!\""},
{"v":"5","t":"Ra-ra-ra-ra-ra-ra-ra-ra-ra Ta-ra-rra-ra."},
{"v":"6","t":"\"It's enough,\" said I, \"to wake----\" and stopped short. Where was I?"},
{"v":"7","t":"Ta-rra-rara--louder and louder."},
{"v":"8","t":"\"It's either some new invention----\""},
{"v":"9","t":"Toora-toora-toora! Deafening!"},
{"v":"10","t":"\"No,\" said I, speaking loud in order to hear myself. \"That's the Last Trump.\""},
{"v":"11","t":"Tooo-rraa!"}
]}
